iqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{"Self-Sustain":{"entries":[{"name":"Blemishine","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Entelechia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Executor the Ex Foedere","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Hoshiguma the Breacher","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":96}},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Doctor, are you ready to work? I won't take no for an answer. C'mon. 3, 2, 1, start.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Nails are part of a girl's appeal. Gotta take good care of them.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"Why do I call myself Utage? Well, it's not that complicated. It means 'Party' in Higashinese, and I just wanna live my life like it's a party every night. If I'm in a good mood, everything else is gonna be okay.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"You already saw it, Doctor? Well, that's too bad. Now the only way out is for you… is to come with me and use this two-for-one coupon.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"When I got Oripathy and started talking about coming here, my mom was worried about bullying. So she gave me the family heirloom, Shishiou, to defend myself. Didn't find any bullies, but I did manage to cut up some pretty bad guys. Doctor, you really know how to treat a girl.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"The people here turn all scary when they get serious. I'm as scary as six of them put together? Really…? Am I that terrifying?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Doc. Help me pick up ten boxes of limited-edition cookie sticks tomorrow? Just give me an advance on my pay. What? I've advanced the whole thing already? Aww c'mon, there's gotta be something you can do. Please, Doctor!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Doctor, you're razor-sharp some of the time and dull as a block at others. I don't get why. Oh, I see, right out of that 'How to Talk to Girls' book, huh? I'd expect nothing less from you, Doctor.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"It's not good to rely too much on any one person, but maybe the Doctor is an... Eek, Doctor! Oh it's nothing, I was just rambling to myself! D-D-Did you need something from me?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"If you're tired, just go to bed. Not that complicated.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Hey, Doctor. I'm your new operator, Utage. My hobbies are... Oh, I don't need to go into the details? Alright then, I look forward to working with you.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Is it over?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Do I get work less after I get promoted? No dice? Oh well…","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"I guess it's time for me to get serious. Alright, let's crush the bad guys!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Alright, everyone, I'll be counting on your orders!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Hmm, team captain… Eh? Me? Captain?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Time to go.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"C'mon, c'mon! I can't wait any longer.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Yeees?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Need me?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Moving out!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Hehe.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Who should I cut?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"It won't hurt if I don't miss.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"I'll take what you don't need.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"You look kinda cute when you cry.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Ahh, it felt good to blow off all that steam. Exciting stuff. Let's go for crepes, Doctor.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"That was so much fun. Thanks for all the enemies!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"You're saving the stragglers for me? Well, I'll dig right in.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"C'mon, Doctor, stop spacing out and start running.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"As long as I can get my magazines, it doesn't really matter where I stay.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Oh?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Wanna go sing karaoke?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Oh, hey, Doctor. Happy New Year! As you can see, I'm trapped under this kotatsu... Hang with me for a bit maybe? It's waaarm. C'mon, just try it, you won't regret it!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Morning, Doctor.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Doctor, happy birthday. Did you know? There's a real trick to birthday parties. I could share some hacks with you, like, on the down-low, to really up your popularity at dinnertime. Number one—wait, are these all your presents?! This whole room?!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"The dinner party today was, like, killer. That's the kind of thing you should really do every day. Otherwise, you start overthinking things and get all hung up on it. Then stuff gets worse and lose all your optimism for life, which is tough to hold onto. Meh, that's just me babbling to myself, don't worry about it. Anyway, enjoy the happiness you've got in the moment, that's what matters most!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Ayaka Kyo"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_337_utage/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Mayu Yoshioka"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_337_utage/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Skye"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_337_utage/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Choi Ha-ri"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_337_utage/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}